<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-27T05:12:49.123Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:12:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad has moved troops into the Kurdish border region after the top court authorized a military presence and the takeover of border posts and oil fields, reinforcing central authority over the Kurdish area. The defense ministry ordered nationwide troop deployment and closed oil smuggling routes, while a drone strike destroyed a militant vehicle in Anbar province. Germany arrested an Iraqi duo suspected of plotting attacks on a synagogue, and an Iraqi court sentenced eight French nationals to life imprisonment for IS group membership. Two Syrian security personnel were killed in an ISIL suicide attack. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPT2MxVEJYVHRnSDRQZzRETWUyMnlCYUJDTTVTVzNuenBwRkRKeTgxZnBDR0VUVWt4akRiYzdMSnc5Sk9PWTBUMy00UFNBeUxsU0F1T1dzcFM2QkFuYTJINzZ1WmJzYUxaZnJoM3U1Q1k3N1JjLXZyQ29TS3IwZ1EwQU0yaXVNcnk0Y3ZIWDFuSzlOekJjb0RyMzdBR1N6TXJITGtzM09PQ2s4Ujg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPcFBlZXpjNmxudmFiTnBwb3VTalZDY1JoR3FaYUpabkNycXJfS2x0aDR4Z2NLNEtyRVowTXVIN1BzR1NMZjhBaU9GUzc4RTBUYWZHTFh4NS03dGQxc2lxQnlBQmNkWnVrdFJKU2lwQjc4OUl5VTVYVHlFWGdPT3QtQUN6dFRnZnNXaDRyLTU4ZGt5cUVPeWhISTdUU0ZHTWNzZDktRTZFUFFBckJ2cGIxcWVwRG5mc2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPeGlKWlRMLUx5SDRZY3FLU3VLM19RX2JqVko0T3dBakVEVHVldFVtQ21MbGo2WEEzUXU1clEteTVvWWh3bkdkQzZPX3RSemt5eWlBVjJQZy1RdjNjNnlpT19ZZUd0ekFDc3JuVHZKVWJfX2VtTlBzU3ZTTHlBX3dkV1NNVXA4NmJMVlRGX3FidmJsa0VacW5fQ2E1ZHBZTnJrN